\p{
  This Cubical Agda mechanization accompanies [[li-grodin-harper-2026]]. It formalizes simply typed directed syntax through localization, the unary gluing model, Boolean canonicity, and the basic binary contravariance result. It is checked with Agda 2.8.0 and the Cubical library 0.9.
}
